A71 (Wi-Fi, ADSP and link parts of iOS 16 0206, 0207, 0210-0215, 0217): RSSI bounds, link quality
and link-state events for wland, clock setter log, ADSP audio SMMU stream 0x1b21 and its translating
bank (sweetsmmuadsp), rpmh/pmem pieces. Framebuffer and AMFI parts of those patches are left out.

